WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.587
Let’s walk through Team Action Review.

00:00:02.587 --> 00:00:06.200
Compare the Scribe-forwarded record with the room’s agreed decision.

00:00:06.200 --> 00:00:09.525
Check completeness, rationale, active move, and lifecycle

00:00:09.525 --> 00:00:12.438
state, then return to the source artifact for corrections

00:00:12.438 --> 00:00:14.838
rather than recreating it in the deck.

00:00:14.838 --> 00:00:18.413
On this slide, review the Scribe-forwarded Strategic Orientation,

00:00:18.413 --> 00:00:21.562
action, or proposal before final submission.

00:00:21.562 --> 00:00:25.150
In practice, check completeness, rationale, team agreement

00:00:25.150 --> 00:00:26.762
, and lifecycle state.

00:00:27.260 --> 00:00:30.835
Return to the team’s record rather than recreating the artifact

00:00:30.835 --> 00:00:31.885
in the deck.

00:00:31.885 --> 00:00:34.885
When you are ready, use Open Team Action Review

00:00:34.885 --> 00:00:36.973
to move to the live surface.

00:00:36.973 --> 00:00:39.835
The guide will not make the workflow decision for you

00:00:39.835 --> 00:00:39.985
.
